cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use SpatioS2E, please cite this software and specify the version used.
title: "SpatioS2E: component-resolved evaluation of gene-conditioned virtual spatial transcriptomics"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Code for comparing Decima and scGPT gene representations in image-based
  spatial expression prediction. The analyses separate improvements in
  gene-mean prediction from improvements in within-gene spatial variation
  across four brain and breast cancer cohorts.
authors:
